  "releases:lmsys:2026-10-25-minite.highlights.2": "miniTE serving throughput about 1.64× BF16; in online RL, weight conversion/sync is about 5.56× slower, offsetting the sampling gain",
  "releases:lmsys:2026-10-26-cf-security.highlights.0": "Cross-request KV leakage in Cloudflare's GLM-5.3 PD-disaggregated deployment: rejected requests still entered the prefill→decode handoff",
  "releases:lmsys:2026-10-26-cf-security.highlights.1": "Decode delays freeing aborted requests' KV slots until prefill returns ABORT_ACK or times out; default from v0.5.21",
  "releases:lmsys:2026-10-26-cf-security.highlights.2": "21 runs on 2×H100 1P1D Mooncake: throughput differences among pre-patch, enabled and disabled are all within ±2%",
  "releases:lmsys:2026-10-22-miles-mi355x-agentic-rl.highlights.0": "Miles agentic RL trains Qwen3-30B-A3B on MI355X; SWE-bench Verified subset pass@1 7.3%→27.5%",
  "releases:lmsys:2026-10-22-miles-mi355x-agentic-rl.highlights.1": "Truncating trajectory length cuts RL step 850 s→284 s; inference scale-up + cloud sandboxes raise rollout ~860→~3,480 per hour",
  "releases:lmsys:2026-10-22-miles-mi355x-agentic-rl.highlights.2": "Long tail: 32% of rollout time occurs after 90% of trajectories finish; trainer–inference logprob gap about 0.011",
