  "quant_evidence:LMSYS miniTE:Qwen3-30B-A3B 完整 learner 更新（序列 4096、GBS .value": "TE BF16 1.00×; TE NVFP4 0.959×; miniTE CUTLASS + MXFP8 backward 1.148×, + BF16 backward 1.369×; miniTE per-token + BF16 backward 1.334× (1.39× after merging all fusions): the preparation overhead of backward quantization cancels the gain from low-precision GEMM; five-item average score at step 999: miniTE 56.35%, BF16 58.84%",
