  "quant_evidence:LMSYS miniTE:训推 log-prob 平均绝对差（Qwen3-4B / Qwen3-30B-A.claim": "Train-inference log-prob mean absolute difference (Qwen3-4B / Qwen3-30B-A3B), weights fixed at NVFP4, varying activation precision",
